[2026-09-26T16:02:28.037+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       ],
[2026-09-26T16:02:28.037+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       "test_focus": [
[2026-09-26T16:02:28.037+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]         "unauthenticated chrome before registration, authenticated current-user state after registration and sign-in",
[2026-09-26T16:02:28.037+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]         "signed-in username still visible after a page reload (session reload path)",
[2026-09-26T16:02:28.037+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]         "no duplicated page-local user state: header/current-user reads the same context"
