[2026-09-26T16:02:28.037+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]         "unit: valid input yields a user with emailVerified true and accepts the credentials through the sign-in path",
[2026-09-26T16:02:28.037+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]         "unit: duplicate username/email never reaches persistence"
[2026-09-26T16:02:28.037+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       ]
