[2026-09-26T16:02:28.037+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       "file_path": "backend/src/database/init_db.js",
[2026-09-26T16:02:28.037+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       "first_line": 1,
[2026-09-26T16:02:28.037+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       "responsibility": "Declares the sign-in-capable account table with uniqueness constraints and verified-email state, using the existing idempotent CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS block in the shared schema lifecycle file.",
[2026-09-26T16:02:28.037+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       "specification": "Extend the existing initialization promise with: CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS users (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT, username TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE, email TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE, password_hash TEXT NOT NULL, email_verified INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0, created_at TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP). No parallel users/account table and no new connection or reset helper may be introduced in feature folders; keep the evolution guarded and idempotent (tolerant ALTER TABLE ... ADD COLUMN for pre-existing DB files). The requirement states a successfully registered account is immediately marked verified, so registration persists email_verified = 1 and there is no separate verification flow or email-verification page anywhere in the app.",
[2026-09-26T16:02:28.037+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       "inputs": "Database file selected by init_db path/harness options.",
[2026-09-26T16:02:28.037+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       "outputs": "users table available on every app start, with UNIQUE constraints on username and email.",
[2026-09-26T16:02:28.037+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       "callers": [
[2026-09-26T16:02:28.037+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]         "REQ-1-1-1-FUNC-AUTH-REPOSITORY",
[2026-09-26T16:02:28.037+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]         "REQ-1-1-1-DB-SEED-ACCOUNTS",
