[2026-09-26T16:02:28.037+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]         "UNIQUE violations on duplicate username/email",
[2026-09-26T16:02:28.037+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]         "existing databases are upgraded without dropping data"
[2026-09-26T16:02:28.037+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       ]
[2026-09-26T16:02:28.037+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]     },
